    "scientific_verdict": "Exhaustive evaluation across all 4^k schedules for k in {1, 2, 3} confirms three exact schedule dualities: (1) global sign negation (epsilon, sigma) -> (-epsilon, -sigma) conjugates the statevector and leaves Born probabilities P(x | y) pointwise invariant; (2) flipping sigma_k -> -sigma_k reflects outcomes as x -> (-x) mod D, partitioning all 4^k schedules into 4^{k-1} Klein four-group orbits with identical E_{epsilon, sigma} and V_HS(epsilon, sigma); and (3) reversing epsilon and internal sigma signs leaves the x=0 readout amplitude <0_D | Psi(y)> and probability P(0 | y) identically invariant.",
